From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yi Xie <imxieyi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 23:27:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mesa Venus pair the generated protocol headers

Carry the Venus protocol codec generated from the pinned venus-protocol
series and the pinned Vulkan-Headers registry, at the tree path the upstream
snapshot reserves for it, so the HAL speaks the same protocol revision as the
renderer it is paired with. The codec's first line names those two trees, so
regenerating it from the same pins reproduces it byte for byte.

Meson refuses an absolute include directory inside the source tree, and the
Soong converter can only express an include directory that lives inside the
project. Let an empty -Dvenus-protocol-dir select the tree's own paired
headers, which this port replaces with the generated codec. A named build
directory keeps its existing meaning and its existing validation.
